ervers",what:"Register and view TB servers and their state.",how:"TB Management › Servers."},{op:"Monitoring",what:"Background monitoring (e.g. RAID / reconnect health) runs on a schedule.",how:"Alerts/state surface in the UI; details are in System › Log › TB Management."}]},{key:"cicd",label:"CI/CD",intro:"Test dashboards backed by TM4J (Test Management for Jira) plus pipeline / deploy views for the SDN project.",steps:[{op:"TM4J dashboard",what:"Per-feature test counts, coverage, test cycles and E2E results.",how:"CI/CD menu. Data syncs from TM4J on a schedule; use the sync controls to refresh."},{op:"Pipelines / Deploy",what:"CI/CD pipeline and deployment status.",how:"CI/CD menu; actions that touch GitHub use your GitHub token."}]},{key:"pipeline-manager",label:"Pipeline Manager",intro:"Create reusable pipelin